  "result": "Done! I've implemented the late fee calculation functionality:\n\n**Added `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` to src/reports.js:**\n- Calculates late fees at 0.04% of the amount still due per day overdue\n- **Calculation:** amountDue \u00d7 0.0004 \u00d7 daysOverdue\n- **Returns 0 if:**\n  - Invoice has no due date\n  - Due date is on or after asOf date (not overdue)\n  - No amount is still due (fully paid invoice)\n  - Calculated fee rounds to less than 1 cent\n- **Uses:**\n  - daysBetween(dueDate, asOf) for days overdue\n  - balanceDue(invoice) for amount still owed\n  - roundCents() for rounding\n- **Returns:** Fee amount in cents, rounded and clamped to \u2265 0\n\n**Added 13 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Not overdue invoices (returns 0)\n- Invoice due today (not overdue)\n- Invoice with no due date\n- 1+ day overdue calculations\n- Fee based on amount due\n- Fully paid invoices (no fee)\n- Partially paid invoices (fee on balance)\n- Fee increases with more days overdue\n- Fee increases with larger amounts\n- Non-negativity\n- 0.04% per day rate verification\n- Different payment terms (NET14, NET30, EOM)\n- Large overdue periods\n\nAll 248 tests pass \u2713 (235 existing + 13 new late fee tests)",
